    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"**Test for My User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for two users.\\n\\n1. In **Predict** and **Using**, choose the label and only the Tree 2 features from **Tree 1 vs. Tree 2** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Train model**.\\n\\nYou are done when your tree shows. Go to the **Testing** tab.\",\r\n  \"results\": \"**Test for My User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for two users.\\n\\nDo these steps for each of your two users.\\n1. In **Make a Prediction**, choose a category for each feature that fits your user. Write them in **Test for My User** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Predict**. Wait until the path stops moving. Write the prediction.\\n3. Compare the prediction to what your user needs. In **Right for them?**, write ✓ if it fits or ✗ if it doesn't.\\n4. Click **Save image** (the camera under your tree). Click **Save to Backpack**.\\n\\nYou are done when Test for My User has both users and your Backpack has a tree for each user.\"\r\n}",
